<title>PHILIPPINES: PCI Leasing 1996 net 261.299 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PCI Leasing 1996 net 261.299 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCI Leasing and Finance Inc said on Monday its unaudited net income reached 261.299 million pesos in 1996 from the year-ago audited net of 140 million.</p>
<p>The firm said its revenues last year reached 1.3 billion pesos and expenses were at 986.89 million.</p>
<p>PCI Leasing is a unit of the Philippine Commercial International Bank.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
